&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Continue growing your technical and business skills in a collaborative, supportive environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
